message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the article below, which
  introduces the package in Section 4.
type: software
title: zero-sum-sequences
abstract: >-
  A Python library for computing with sequences over finite additive
  groups: minimal zero-sum sequences (atoms), factorizations and their
  length sets, automorphism orbits, and zero-sum constants.
